```java
// Spring Boot 3.2: identity in the path, filters as optional query params
@GetMapping("/users/{id}")                 // GET /users/123
User get(@PathVariable Long id) { return service.findById(id); }

@GetMapping("/users")                      // GET /users?status=active&page=0
List<User> list(
        @RequestParam(required = false) String status,
        @RequestParam(defaultValue = "0") int page) {
    return service.find(status, page);     // works with or without the params
}
```
